<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's CMVM suspends trade Engil, A.Silva.</title>
<headline>Portugal's CMVM suspends trade Engil, A.Silva.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) has suspended trade in shares of construction companies Engil-SGPS and A.Silva &amp; Silva, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
